cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  Cite the INSP situation reports first; they are the work and this
  repository is a transcription of them. Use these metadata as a
  secondary reference.
title: >-
  bvd-sitreps: a machine-readable corpus of the INSP situation
  reports for the 2026 DRC Bundibugyo virus outbreak
abstract: >-
  Every situation report published by the Institut National de Sante
  Publique of the Democratic Republic of the Congo for the 2026
  Bundibugyo virus disease outbreak, transcribed from PDF to French
  markdown, with the tables extracted to CSV and English translations
  rendered as a website. Each file records the source URL and the md5
  of the PDF it came from. Transcription and translation are machine
  generated and have not been reviewed by a person.
authors:
  - family-names: Sherratt
    given-names: Katharine
repository-code: "https://github.com/epiforecasts/bvd-sitreps"
url: "https://epiforecasts.io/bvd-sitreps"
license: MIT
keywords:
  - Ebola
  - Bundibugyo virus
  - Democratic Republic of the Congo
  - outbreak surveillance
  - situation reports
references:
  - type: report
    title: "Situation reports on the 17th Ebola virus disease epidemic"
    authors:
      - name: >-
          Institut National de Sante Publique, Democratic Republic
          of the Congo
    year: 2026
    url: "https://insp.cd/ebola-17eme-epidemie/"
    notes: >-
      The source of every report in this corpus. INSP holds whatever
      rights attach to them; see data/LICENSE.md.
